{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f50d05c27f36cc4e936caf068456b04d534e575bad07ad621a70703b1bd9b46", "ja": "（今日はアイドルグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の\n撮影。可奈はパンケーキを運ぶらしい……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像写真杂志《爱偶像！！》的拍摄。听说可奈要端着松饼过来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "bc90b324d34d34967a0290e6cd1c93c986d400e7f394b5364e8a8d64ff79b149", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせしました～！\n撮影、張り切っていきましょうっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让您久等啦～！\n拍摄工作，打起精神上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1002_p", "source_sha256": "85fc668d19e568344453592054eae25e28eeda596f6c8d66860cd3474f665063", "ja": "おっ、やる気満々だな、可奈。", "zh": "哦，干劲十足啊，可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "40f28843dc81ccd178ab5d22931afe0235a1875dcd38dbc4a28c48cee6791545", "ja": "はい！　衣装もすっごく可愛いですし、\nパンケーキも一緒なんですよ、パンケーキ♪", "zh": "是的！服装也超级可爱，而且还有松饼呢，松饼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "dc6bf44264feef99081d78cb153b8ebc268c0decce2657e70d388f3c24e23271", "ja": "さっき見せてもらったんですけど\nいっぱい積み上がってて、すごく美味しそうでした！", "zh": "刚才让我看过了，\n堆得高高的，看起来特别好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2aee5e5d661c438c940325576842e3aa8efbb42b25bdb59b590b1f1120e046ac", "ja": "気に入ってくれてよかったよ。でもパンケーキ、\n15段あるらしいけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "你喜欢就好。不过听说松饼有15层，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "834ec777c28d32614aa397198807210b720fc048cb88116014c302254e9e2b12", "ja": "大丈夫です！　私、けっこうバランス感覚は\nある方だと思うんですよ！　多分……。", "zh": "没问题的！我觉得自己的平衡感\n还是相当不错的哦！大概吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "4230db2433781f4fe3e315a2b82ed5c27efecf7b5f28bf100ff2c758dae3c623", "ja": "それに、美味しいパンケーキを崩すわけには\nいきませんから！　任せてください！", "zh": "而且，我可不能把美味的松饼弄散！交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d02604d963ea497b8ca7736203e2a6cc7135f1f0c9287e795d0f78ba026a07e1", "ja": "お、おお、そうか……じゃあ、よろしくな！", "zh": "哦、哦哦，是吗……那就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "3d9b98edb2b0c260809d7ab43dfecbd1bc4b251366b59091e3faf7e39777da4f", "ja": "うぅっ……近くで見るとますますおいしそう……。\nあっ、焼きたての匂い～♪", "zh": "呜呜……近距离一看，感觉更好吃了……  \n啊，刚出炉的香味～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "e67956c4270a72a8f65b4454e7a3328c3b58d0547f1f96f4b660668e9a4547a1", "ja": "くんくん……はぁ～。\n匂いはグー、お腹もぐぅ～っ♪", "zh": "闻闻……哈啊～  \n香味满分，肚子也咕咕叫～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1012_kantoku", "source_sha256": "b825e394681336da9d791457977939931069a27c27b140760363e235b1e7cac5", "ja": "カーット！　ええと……矢吹さん。\n匂いはもういいので、持ち上げてください。", "zh": "咔——！那个……矢吹小姐。\n已经不用闻了，请把它举起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "bd068c3554882aa559592a9d5a74610d8e8aa4194ee783ac6725f61f02c0f296", "ja": "わわっ！　す、すみません……！\nあんまり美味しそうだから、つい……え、えへへっ。", "zh": "哇哇！对、对不起……！\n因为看起来实在太好吃了，忍不住就……嘿、嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1014_p", "source_sha256": "56158789346413a39da29d56477e17a0f4f90770b4d13a23a86f4a6862508b8c", "ja": "（その後、なんとか撮影は進み、\n休憩時間になった……）", "zh": "（之后，拍摄总算顺利进行下去，到了休息时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "6b20cd6031892d3b2e1c2e59c0986af26a797100e3a5b809949f75b99f7f1f0a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ごめんなさーいっ！\nバランス感覚より、食欲の方が大問題でした……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，对不起——！\n比起平衡感，食欲才是更大的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8b1252219f9b19dec2ccf970755db412b9c74f636cce15642ba33aec1b1c41fa", "ja": "うーん……そうだ可奈、撮影が終わったら、\nあのパンケーキを食べていいか聞いてみようか？", "zh": "嗯……对了，可奈，拍摄结束后，要不要问问能不能吃那个松饼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "4e5aeb19de6153d4d351e7090759888af1427598367fe78c02d2d6a43b177946", "ja": "えっ、ほ、本当ですか！？\nあれを食べてもいいんですか？　ごくり……！", "zh": "诶，真、真的吗！？\n那个可以吃吗？咕咚……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9cb4034eecae6753557200380b4814fec5ca8feaf329fabca3d5ef71a7a67625", "ja": "まあ聞いてみてからだけど、多分大丈夫だと思うよ。\nだから、撮影が終わるまでもう少し頑張れそうか？", "zh": "虽然还得先问问看，不过我想大概没问题。\n所以，在拍摄结束前还能再加把劲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "5044e1977fe3d4ba2ff74e33804f047e60c748512ff55aaded447e4d10c79574", "ja": "は、はい！　そういうことなら、\n私、いっぱい頑張れちゃいます！", "zh": "是、是！既然是这样，我就能再加把劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "1ea60f817d91566ddf7c028078540b260d6caffac611dc20e1cc9d627e9e03d3", "ja": "わーい！　うちのお店のパンケーキ～♪\n見た目もおいしいべっぴんさん～♪　絶品さ～♪", "zh": "耶！我们店里的松饼～♪\n看起来也是美味的大美人～♪　真是极品呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0243_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6a566b0a32f6e3f5aa586126abef8e82e09f67b78a87f51cba00dc913486601d", "ja": "（可奈の写真は、とにかくパンケーキが美味しそう\nだという事で、評判になった。やったな、可奈！）", "zh": "（可奈拍的照片因为把松饼拍得格外诱人而获得了好评。干得漂亮，可奈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
